  {
   "id": "dwerve-121791@major-2022-11-04",
   "gameId": "dwerve-121791",
   "displayName": "Dwerve is 15% off! New Quality of Life Update Now Live!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-04T05:51:38.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi Warsmiths!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "15% Discount!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "To kickoff these events, we've released a new Quality of Life Update! 5 months after launch, we've continued to work hard to improve the game with the help of our community! Thanks to everyone who gave us feedback! ❤️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "5 Month Progress",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Here's some of the key changes we've made over the past few months:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Balanced a ton of turrets, upgrades, and enemies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Streamlined levels design for more fluid progression",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved battles to offer a more strategic experience",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed redundant or tedious puzzles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed unnecessary dialogues for less interruption",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased Dwerve's movement speed — several times!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a ton of more graphics and UX options",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added ability to move through your own turrets",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added selling upgrades back at full price",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added more health potions and armor drops",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added backtracking to collect missed keys",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added build preview to see where your turret will get built",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added recall preview to see which turret will get recalled",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added ability to skip dialogues and fast-forward cutscenes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added exclamation particles to indicate battle triggers",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optimized the build size",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made all sneak sections optional",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a gazillion bugs: We're happy with how much the game has improved thanks to you all! Now we can focus on new features like.... * drum roll * ...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Classic TD Mode!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Classic TD is a new upcoming game mode that has traditional tower defense gameplay. Build more and more turrets over time to defeat waves of enemies before they reach the objective. The game mode is currently in Beta testing but will be released as part of the main game in the coming weeks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
